      "end_sec": 200.9,
      "duration_sec": 4.4,
      "audio_start_sec": 196.5,
      "audio_end_sec": 200.9,
      "text": "Yes, you did. You've been putting it up your whole life. You just didn't know it."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "segment_id": "seg_0063",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 202.58,
      "end_sec": 204.1,
      "duration_sec": 1.52,
      "audio_start_sec": 202.58,
      "audio_end_sec": 204.1,
      "text": "You know what date is on this coin?"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "segment_id": "seg_0064",
      "speaker_id": "GAS_STATION_PROPRIETOR",
      "start_sec": 204.88,
      "end_sec": 205.08,
      "duration_sec": 0.2,
      "audio_start_sec": 204.88,
      "audio_end_sec": 205.08,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "segment_id": "seg_0065",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 205.42,
      "end_sec": 213.44,
      "duration_sec": 8.02,
      "audio_start_sec": 205.42,
      "audio_end_sec": 213.44,
      "text": "1958. It's been traveling 22 years to get here, and now it's here, and it's either heads or tails,"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "segment_id": "seg_0066",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 214.72,
      "end_sec": 215.94,
      "duration_sec": 1.22,
      "audio_start_sec": 214.72,
      "audio_end_sec": 215.94,
      "text": "and you have to say call it."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "segment_id": "seg_0067",
      "speaker_id": "GAS_STATION_PROPRIETOR",
      "start_sec": 216.7,
      "end_sec": 219.62,
      "duration_sec": 2.92,
      "audio_start_sec": 216.7,
      "audio_end_sec": 219.62,
      "text": "Look, I n- need to know what I stand to win."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "segment_id": "seg_0068",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 219.76,
      "end_sec": 220.299,
      "duration_sec": 0.539,
      "audio_start_sec": 219.76,
      "audio_end_sec": 220.299,
      "text": "Everything."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "segment_id": "seg_0069",
      "speaker_id": "GAS_STATION_PROPRIETOR",
      "start_sec": 221.8,
      "end_sec": 222.29,
      "duration_sec": 0.49,
      "audio_start_sec": 221.8,
      "audio_end_sec": 222.29,
      "text": "How's that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "segment_id": "seg_0070",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 222.78,
      "end_sec": 224.6,
      "duration_sec": 1.82,
      "audio_start_sec": 222.78,
      "audio_end_sec": 224.6,
      "text": "You stand to win everything. Call it."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "segment_id": "seg_0071",
      "speaker_id": "GAS_STATION_PROPRIETOR",
      "start_sec": 229.42,
      "end_sec": 229.84,
      "duration_sec": 0.42,
      "audio_start_sec": 229.42,
      "audio_end_sec": 229.84,
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "segment_id": "seg_0072",
      "speaker_id": "GAS_STATION_PROPRIETOR",
      "start_sec": 231.68,
      "end_sec": 232.46,
      "duration_sec": 0.78,
      "audio_start_sec": 231.68,
      "audio_end_sec": 232.46,
      "text": "Heads then."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "segment_id": "seg_0073",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 237.56,
      "end_sec": 238.08,
      "duration_sec": 0.52,
      "audio_start_sec": 237.56,
      "audio_end_sec": 238.08,
      "text": "Well done."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "segment_id": "seg_0074",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 240.72,
      "end_sec": 241.64,
      "duration_sec": 0.92,
      "audio_start_sec": 240.72,
      "audio_end_sec": 241.64,
      "text": "Don't put it in your pocket."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "segment_id": "seg_0075",
      "speaker_id": "GAS_STATION_PROPRIETOR",
      "start_sec": 241.76,
      "end_sec": 241.98,
      "duration_sec": 0.22,
      "audio_start_sec": 241.76,
      "audio_end_sec": 241.98,
      "text": "Sir?"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "segment_id": "seg_0076",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 242.74,
      "end_sec": 244.6,
      "duration_sec": 1.86,
      "audio_start_sec": 242.74,
      "audio_end_sec": 244.6,
      "text": "Don't put it in your pocket. It's your lucky quarter."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "segment_id": "seg_0077",
      "speaker_id": "GAS_STATION_PROPRIETOR",
      "start_sec": 246.64,
      "end_sec": 247.94,
      "duration_sec": 1.3,
      "audio_start_sec": 246.64,
      "audio_end_sec": 247.94,
      "text": "Where you want me to put it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "segment_id": "seg_0078",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 248.04,
      "end_sec": 249.12,
      "duration_sec": 1.08,
      "audio_start_sec": 248.04,
      "audio_end_sec": 249.12,
      "text": "Anywhere not in your pocket"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "segment_id": "seg_0079",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 250.38,
      "end_sec": 253.22,
      "duration_sec": 2.84,
      "audio_start_sec": 250.38,
      "audio_end_sec": 253.22,
      "text": "or it'll get mixed in with the others and become just a coin."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "segment_id": "seg_0080",
      "speaker_id": "ANTON_CHIGURH",
      "start_sec": 257.84,
      "end_sec": 258.399,
      "duration_sec": 0.559,
      "audio_start_sec": 257.84,
      "audio_end_sec": 258.399,
      "text": "Which it is."
    }
  ]
}